{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2a468988-be4a-8eeb-9a09-8edae37d07f9",
  "created_at": "2026-01-09T14:27:22-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Stephen Sherman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:25:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:25:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Stephen Sherman. I am not sure if I have the right office. I want to make a complaint about my neighbor's fence."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:25:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A fence. Tell me what's going on with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:25:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The fence is leaning over onto my yard. It is leaning more every week. With the wind today from the storm, I am afraid it will go down. Ai, meu Deus. I would like a complaint taken."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:25:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Let me make sure I understand. The fence belongs to your neighbor, and it's tilting onto your side of the property line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:25:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct. Onto my side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:25:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And you're not sure which department deals with that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:25:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I do not know. Is it you, or the building people, or somebody else? I did not want to call the wrong one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:26:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair, it can be a few places. Usually something like this goes to the inspections side, the zoning and building folks. I don't take those complaints here myself. I can transfer you, if you'd like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:26:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. That would be good. But if the line is busy, can you take my name and number for them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:26:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can do that too. Go ahead, slowly is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:26:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Stephen Sherman. S-H-E-R-M-A-N. The number is 401-555-0190."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:26:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Stephen Sherman, 401-555-0190. Let me read that back. Four oh one, five five five, oh one nine oh. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:26:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:26:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And is there anything else I should note about the fence? How long it's been leaning, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:26:48-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few months now. I did not call before. Today the wind is strong, so I decided to call. Also, I am sorry if my voice is not clear. This morning I hung a new curtain rod, and I am still, how you say, getting my breath."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:27:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, I hear you fine. Okay, I'll put you through now. If it drops, stay it away from it until it's looked at, and they'll get the details from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:27:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will. Thank you very much, Mr. Owen. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T14:27:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Hold on, transferring you now."
    }
  ],
